# Lint before every commit.
#
# This is here because it was not: the 1.0 package owned the hook, and when
# that package went the hook went with it. Nothing else runs eslint — there is
# no CI — so the count drifted to 98 problems before anybody counted.
#
# Lint only. A typecheck and the test suite are another twenty-five seconds,
# which is the kind of wait people learn to pass with --no-verify.
npm run precommit
